Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've sure grown up a lot since\Nthat summer in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai's in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother Matt's trying\Nto be a rock star.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora's become quite a tennis\Nplayer. Izzy's in high school too,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi and her folks moved to New York,\Nand Joe's still studying to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for Kari and I,\Nit's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.42,0:00:39.46,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,full speed de mawari hajimeta story
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.42,0:00:39.46,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,At full-speed, a story starts spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.46,0:00:44.26,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.46,0:00:44.26,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,painting the earth red
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.55,0:00:51.81,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chikyuu-gi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.55,0:00:51.81,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,The globe is but an empty paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.81,0:00:56.48,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,boku-ra no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.81,0:00:56.48,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Let's free it by ourselves
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.11,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.44,0:01:03.11,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Now put all your heart into running
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I not yet? I did now. I'm in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.11,0:01:08.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.11,0:01:08.37,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,through the steep endless road, far away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it again.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.96,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,tachiagare! yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.96,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I gotta stand up! There's a hero in me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it goes in the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And near the target.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.96,0:01:23.88,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.96,0:01:23.88,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I'll never lose to such a towering target
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.88,0:01:29.93,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,moeagare! kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.88,0:01:29.93,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I gotta flare up! The heartbeat in my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten the tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.93,0:01:36.52,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.93,0:01:36.52,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,I'll take back our forgotten tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go back and go\Nback to the next battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.52,0:01:42.24,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}atsui battle okose
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.52,0:01:42.24,Target Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)}Starting a hot battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the evil Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:01:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.50,0:02:35.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(315,0)\c&HDBFAF0&\fscx120\fscy120\pos(316,326)}The Heir to Courage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be late for school, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and finish your breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New school, new apartment, but\Nthe same old lumpy oatmeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.05,0:02:43.50,Title2,,0,0,300,,Takaishi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.19,0:02:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't drive you to\Nschool on your first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to write this\Narticle before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about the historical\Nsignificance of toilet paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it's okay. I'll walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:02:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name's TK And my mom and I just moved\Ninto this building I'm in 7th grade,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.95,CharCards,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)}Takeru "T.K." Takaishi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Class A Nice to meet you Oh, hi,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.20,0:03:20.37,CharCards,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Yolei Inoue
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name is Yoli Would you like\Nto walk to school with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes exactly 12.3 minutes And that's\Nif there's no wind It'll be fun Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this is Cody
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.40,0:03:25.88,CharCards,,0,0,0,,{\fad(510,0)}Cody Hida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the building, TK Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't want to be late on\Nour first day Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoli, can you come over after\Nschool and fix my computer again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only if your mom makes\Nthose brownies I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send an email and ask her if\Nshe'll make a batch right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a deal. Perfecto. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Great catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the goggles.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.70,0:04:06.55,CharCards,,0,0,0,,{\fad(510,510)}Davis Motomiya
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, you're holding up the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a much better soccer\Nplayer than that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, with luck, you're\Nin my class again, Kari.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.30,0:04:24.81,CharCards,,0,0,0,,{\fad(510,0)}Kari Kamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call that luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the weirdest thing just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This new kid said I\Nreminded him of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably thinks I'm a movie star. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, help! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Mr. Hamasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be your teacher, and I'd like\Nyou all to welcome a new student.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.59,Blackboard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(477,70)}Takaishi Takeru
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm T.K. It's that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take a seat next to the girl\Nwith the camera around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's trying to\Nmake a move on my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our teacher looks like Ogremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let Snimon catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This praying mantis Digimon can cut through\Nanything with his twin-sickles attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twin-sickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Biyomon! Tentomon! Ogremon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I need your help, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like riding a bicycle.\NNow start pedaling and Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use, as long as I\Nhave the black digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move your tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better contact the others.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.15,0:06:05.52,Title2,,0,0,190,,{\fs20\}Come to the \NDigital World \Nright away. \NThe Digimon \Nneed our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to the digital world right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be a link to an online game.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.75,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs13\a5\pos(240,176)}Come to the \NDigital World \Nright away. \NThe Digimon \Nneed our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see who sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai Kamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a girl in the seventh\Ngrade with the same last name.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.25,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\a5\pos(106,114)}Come to the \NDigital World \Nright away. \NThe Digimon \Nneed our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This email's probably hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, TK, how does your mom\Nlike the new apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't seen it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been on the computer the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is not Buddy. It's T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, TJ or JB or whatever\Nit is, how do you know Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're jealous of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not jealous of anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Kari, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you related to Tai?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.45,0:06:49.70,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\a5\pos(214,225)}{\u1}{\u0}Come to the \NDigital World \Nright away. \NThe Digimon \Nneed our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sent this email.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoli, I'm glad I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to use the\Ncomputer room right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the legendary former computer\Nclub president is actually looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai sent us an urgent email.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just about to send Tai an answer\Nwhen the battery ran out of my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have\Nrecharged it after I played
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trigonometry trivia on\Nthe Internet last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, boy, talk about fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.65,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\a5\pos(157,66)}Izumi "Izzy" Koshiro
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.65,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\a5\pos(158,123)}On our way, Tai!\NKari and T.K.\Nare with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got Kari and TK with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, come here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the Digital World?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a new amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they have some great rides.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about it from Tai once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said there were a lot of\NDigimon there, whatever they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They play on the same soccer team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all go to the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, weren't you coming over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, you were gonna fix my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate to the digital world's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got the Crest of Courage on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it an egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never saw an egg with a spike in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been rough on the\Nchicken that laid that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a closer look at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really fast ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did promise. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going back to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just anybody can go, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, TC.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can go, so can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a different model\Nthan the ones we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better go now, while the gate\Nto the digital world is still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how long will it stay open for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to help my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I get Donkey\NMadness on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the digital world sends you a Digivice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there's a reason, and\Nyou should take it serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not waiting any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, unless you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The computer must need a new screensaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, my first time being\Ndownloaded. Pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the digital world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this place comes\Nwith a new wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have some\Nvisitors in my garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they weren't even on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't seem so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way Tai put it,\Nmonsters are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a little thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, very funny, huh? So\Nwere those things Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yep there's tons of other\Nones too a lot cuter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than those and a lot\Nscarier ones too do they all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come out of vending\Nmachines they're real close
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,KK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you all made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told those guys you'd be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Davis, what are you doing here? Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hornblaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, this bossy human appeared and\Nbegan making Digimon into his slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said, I am the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard we're all going to have\Nto punch a time clock, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another human?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that someone else\Ncomes here besides us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there goes the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's got this strange new dark\Ndigivice that makes us unable to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are yours. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this one? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You work for the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't work for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, mine's not dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got this thing when\Nit came out of the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what came out of\Nthe egg when I picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three new digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why did Davis get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his purpose in the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, who\Ngot the other two digivices?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone disappear to, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you already, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you\Noff the hook that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding\Nsomething from me, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what is the digital world,\Nand what exactly are Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finn, what do you call this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody's got one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Yoli's not coming over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stay after\Nschool for Computer Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since you made the brownies, I'll\Ncome home and pick them up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark Digivice is draining our power\Nand making us all weak as newborn kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you couldn't Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if I could Digivolve,\Nhe wouldn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor uses these powerful\Ndark rings to control the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once the ring captures\Nyou, you're a slave for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These collars do everything\Nbut get rid of fleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Emperor, I'm gonna\Nslap a dark ring on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think so, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is just a game to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid that if you\Ncan't play by my rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to have to disqualify you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you'll destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eenie, meenie, miney, moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack, monochromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a deflated beach ball Yeah,\Nplus it's heavier than my mom's meatloaf
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't budge Move aside,\Nthis is a woman's job
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad we don't have a woman here to help
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, I pump iron all\Nthe time Let me do it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys need to work out a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moved that Digi-Egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Beemon, but you\Ncould just call me Beemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of Beemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, he's a fun-loving,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adventure-seeking little Digimon\Nthat brings you good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought he was just a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, I'm real, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've been waiting a very\Nlong time to meet you, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think you got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, you're the one, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you're the only one who was\Nable to move the Digi-Egg of Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I have the Crest of Courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't move the\NDigi-Egg, but Davis could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that, an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's a Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shell is harder than diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His attack, Volcanic Strike,\Nsends out millions of fireballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Volcanic Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, hurry up and open the digi-egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, tell me, what hurts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything but my earlobes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You control the digi-egg of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to use your\Ncourage to open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not safe. Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can digivolve if you open the egg,\Nbut you have to have courage to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here. Kai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move my ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis! Have courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor, energize! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, armor, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters!\NDigimon, you're the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon, you're the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the Fire of Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digivolve? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Fladramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As V-mon, I use the Digi-Egg\Nof Courage to Armor Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fire rocket attack will charbroil\Nthe enemy like a well-done steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digivolve, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Against the power of my dark digivice,\Nthey shouldn't be able to digivolve at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're more resourceful than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things are starting to\Naccelerate into something that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was stomping over Trouble, but\Nlike now, organic strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barbecue that dark ring, Langer-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good monochromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You summoned me, evil emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that we found\Nourselves a worthy foe at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a foe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, monochromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the\NDigimon Emperor can turn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a nice Digimon into\Nsuch a nasty creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice working with you, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, that armor\NDigivolving was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though the rest\Nof us can't Digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you new guys will be able to\Ndefeat the Digimon Emperor with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, I think you were really\Nbrave back there in that battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I noticed that you broke your goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as we all know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the leader of the Digidestined just\Nwouldn't look right without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here, I want you to have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can relax. Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor\Nnever appears at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Tai, but it is getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys need to go home soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sure do, but I'm not even\Nsure if we can get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never stay too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, Cody's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we go to the digital world now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate might close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least I got the brownies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best thing I've ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what does it mean when the\Nlight on that thing goes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw the light go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, let me in. It's Daisuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:20:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crushing my brownies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Davis and the others have\Nreturned to the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digimon Emperor was\Nplanning his next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can the Digidestined stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new adventure has just begun\Non Digimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.39,0:21:22.43,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.39,0:21:22.43,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a bit, everybody's completely different from yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm a little girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.43,0:21:28.39,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto mite mite yokogao no silhouette mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.43,0:21:28.39,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Try to look and see for a bit! Even your face's silhouette looks matured
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, look at me. I\Nfeel like I'm a little girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.39,0:21:34.38,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,chotto kimi kimi iiwake o shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.39,0:21:34.38,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, wait! Your wanting to get an excuse is understandable
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you, like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a little girl I don't know what\Nyou feel like I feel like you're an
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.38,0:21:40.57,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.38,0:21:40.57,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,But if the world's like this, then nothing's ever gonna get done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old kid. It seems like you are a little
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girl, I feel like I'm a little girl. Oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.57,0:21:46.44,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,da ne! kimochi ii kuuki o
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.57,0:21:46.44,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Right? I want to breathe...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.44,0:21:52.39,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ima! suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.44,0:21:52.39,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Now! ...a nice breeze! I can't help it, just can't help it!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.39,0:21:58.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.39,0:21:58.10,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow my wind will blow
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.10,0:22:04.13,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,sekaijuu no door akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.10,0:22:04.13,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,so leave the world's doors open
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.13,0:22:10.07,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.13,0:22:10.07,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow my wind will blow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.07,0:22:18.91,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,kimi no sono yowamushi o mouretsu ni fukitobasu yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.07,0:22:18.91,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,so your cowardice will be blown away
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.51,0:22:28.84,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,gorgeous na jinsei o!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.51,0:22:28.84,Ashita Karaoke EN,,0,0,0,,in a gorgeous life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next episode of Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you next
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time on our next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of Digimon Adventure\N02: "Digital Gate, Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gate is open.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.41,0:23:02.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,0)\c&HD9FAED&\fscx150\fscy150\pos(318,331)}Digital Gate, Open

